---
import InnerPage from '../../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
import { BOOK_CALL_URL } from '../../config/site';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Community"
	description="TeleTrex Community: Digital solution that consolidates and streamlines community management so you can grow and focus on your mission and purpose."
>
	<h1>TeleTrex Community</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		<strong>Holistic, one-stop, community management and information hub. </strong>
    <br/><br/>
    <p>
    You are trying to grow your community membership, manage your online and real-life
    events, provide member access based on roles and member level, and ensure the
    proper waivers have been executed and recorded. You are also wrestling with
    all the distribution channels to get the word out.  You are tired of copying
    and pasting information from disparate systems to create a complete picture
    of your organization.  You want to focus on what your community provides and
    know there is a better way, especially in the age of AI. 
    </p>
    <p>
    Community delivers a scalable solution that manages your memberships,
    payments, and member levels and provides those resources as authorized.
    </p>
    <p>
    Community keeps the public and your members informed as to the  community's
    mission, purpose, and past and upcoming events. Community supports member groups
    enabling the provisioning of content, operational information and events based on
    membership level and acheivements.
    </p>
    <p>Event management is streamlined, providing event notifications, calendars,
    announcement pages, and sign-up and sign-in management including waiver management
    and signed waiver tracking.
    </p>
    <p>
    <p>
    TeleTrex brings a simple, yet through process, to audit and discover the pain
    points in your business and community to design and  apply powerful,
    configurable solutions quickly that can evolve over time.
    We create a plan of attack to address the most impactful areas early on,
    and then extend the postive outcomes over a broader scope.
    </P>

  	<h2 class="section-title">Secure</h2> 
    <p>
    Unlike most solutions today which naively ignored security, Community is designed
    by engineers experienced in securing Fortune 500 data. Community supports
    role-based access control, data-encryption in-transit and at-rest, and
    industry standard network security with monitored and controlled access
    points. Community keeps all of your customer information in your datacenter
    or virtual private cloud (VPC) while providing answers specific to each user.
    </p>
    <p>
    Community leverages the most relevent AI technology, keeping costs low,
    providing on-demand reconfiguration and customization.
  	</p>

    <h2 class="section-title">The user is the center of everything we do.</h2> 
	<p class="prose-block">
		Community plugs into how you already talk to people: your site, your email,
    and the channels you care about. We teach it on your community and event details to
    make it a helpful member of your team, just as you would want to find
    at any business you interact with.
    Community is designed to simplify your work and automate key workflow so you
    can focus on your mission.  Updates to your digital presence are made in one
    place, providing holistic mission control in one place.
	</p>

	<h2 class="section-title">Best for</h2>
	<ul class="prose-block bullets">
		<li>Community administrators that want to consolidate all the online service into
    one place.</li>
    <li>Communities that want to customize and update their online presences easily</li>
    with drag-and-drop components and versioned editing.</li>
		<li>Founders looking to build a solid home for their ecosystem.</li>
    <li>Mulit-lingual communities that need translation of their content without
    requiring special translation services.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 class="section-title">What you get</h2>
	<ul class="prose-block bullets">
		<li>Consolidation of your tools into a single place.Faster first response, objections handled effeciently, so more leads land.</li>
    <li>Control over your online presence so you can present your community exactly
    as you wish without wrestling with all the different tools from different services.
		<li>Support from a team experienced in deployments ranging from
    connecting Fortune 500 vendors and retailers to building online advertising
    supported communities for companies readying for IPOs to non-profit organizations.</li>
		<li>A team open to your specific needs with decades of experience in applying AI with positive impact.</li>
	</ul>

	<p class="prose-block relay-actions">
		<a class="btn btn--primary" href={BOOK_CALL_URL}>Book a call</a>
		<a class="inline-back" href="/products">← All products</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.bullets {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}

	.bullets li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.inline-back {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.inline-back:hover {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.relay-actions {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
	}
</style>
